Summary of modifications (2026-09) relative to robotics_arXiv_daily/daily_arxiv.py:
  * Rewritten fetching: direct arXiv API (Atom) parsing without the `arxiv`
    package, with rate-limit backoff, a circuit breaker, and fallbacks to the
    arxiv.org search page, arxiv.org/abs pages and the arXiv daily RSS feeds.
  * Replaced one-query-per-keyword grouping with broad retrieval plus local,
    configurable rule-based multi-label classification (Sim / VTLA / VTA / Other).
  * Added tactile-modality detection (numeric taxel/force vs. vision-based).
  * Added curated seed references (seeds.yaml) and manual curation (curation.yaml).
  * Replaced the Markdown/Jekyll output with a JSON database, a generated
    PAPERS.md, and a standalone searchable web page (docs/index.html).
  * Removed automatic git push; added cron/daemon scheduling scripts.

